<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan-Mar industry output seen up 2.1% qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan-Mar industry output seen up 2.1% qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Friday it expects industrial output in the January-March quarter to rise 2.1 percent quarter-on-quarter and 6.7 year-on-year.</p>
<p>In the October-December quarter Japan's industrial output rose 3.2 percent from the previous quarter and 4.9 percent from a year earlier.</p>
</text>
